    "Online Marketing",
    "We implement performance marketing campaigns that sustainably increase your visibility on all relevant marketing channels such as Google, Bing, Amazon and other marketplaces and search engines. Holistically, we measure, understand and optimize your online marketing and deliver intelligent tools that increase your efficiency and transactions through automation. Last but not least, we also deliver the right content that reaches your target group in a personalized way.Our online marketing services include:",
    "More success for your website with professional search engine optimization! As one of the largest and most established SEO agencies in Germany, we have been effectively analyzing and optimizing websites from almost all industries, B2C as well as B2B, for over 15 years - so that you find the customers you are looking for!",
    "Good, authentic content is a professional matter. To ensure that \"content is king\" is not just a phrase, we at diva-e rely on a strong team of over 30 editorially trained in-house writers and editors. With a deep understanding of SEO and the user journey, they work closely with our other specialists in all audiovisual content formats. Our concentrated content expertise is complemented by a permanent pool of over 250 international authors.",
    "Whether it's classic pay-per-click (PPC) marketing, commission-based user acquisition partnerships or CRO consulting, our channel expertise for your value-added ad placement covers all relevant areas in paid advertising.",
    "Affiliate marketing has become an important component of online marketing and it is impossible to imagine data-driven marketing without it. Used in the right place, affiliate marketing can make a significant contribution to increasing the success of a company. With our expertise in this area, we create a good basis for successful affiliate marketing.",
    "We ensure that you place messages in the right place in social media. To do this, we pick up your target group and complex customer segments exactly where they regularly spend time. We develop tailor-made concepts for all common social media channels, which increase loyalty and ensure engaged customers.",
    "Comprehensive analyses and precise tracking are worth their weight in gold when it comes to defining concrete measures for optimizing success, as they provide valuable insights into target groups. We work with a broad portfolio of the most modern tools in tracking and analytics and have the necessary know-how to take your business to the next level.",
    "In customer-centric omni-channel marketing, we accompany you from the initial idea and consultation to technological implementation. We develop an omni-channel strategy for you that includes all channels relevant to your target group and optimally exploits their potential. Only when all contact points interact coherently can a seamless, personalized customer journey work.",
    "Tracking the entire customer journey provides valuable data that can be used to address target groups even more precisely. Our team of experts evaluates the data from the best and most modern tracking tools and uses it to form a concept for performance enhancement that is perfectly tailored to your company. We accompany you from conception to implementation.",
    "Development of the ZEISS VISUSTORE digital B2B platform to enable more self-service and more efficient ordering processes",
